 <name>resvg</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Render SVG to PNG in-process with resvg</summary>
 <description>Render SVG documents to PNG bytes in-process, backed by a
statically linked, hash-verified build of resvg 0.48.1. Byte-identical to
the upstream resvg CLI on every gated fixture row. Holds a reusable font
database per renderer; documents parse once and render many. Ships
PNG fidelity and toSvg writer gates, resource ceilings, and opt-in
resource confinement for untrusted input.</description>
